abstract: >-
  Public implementation of unique-material-state aggregation,
  parent-material-grouped predictive validation, nested RMSE
  tuning, lithology-specific thermal-conductivity response-surface modelling,
  convex-hull-restricted evaluation, Response-Surface Consistency Index
  diagnostics, model-role review, and response-profile extraction for mineral
  soils. Restricted record-level reference-analysis data are not distributed.
